1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,519
SHELDON:
Please, Penny, enough. I have to sleep.

2
00:00:05,814 --> 00:00:08,654
PENNY:
Okay, well, you were great. Thanks.

3
00:00:11,528 --> 00:00:14,488
Oh. Listen, don't go in Sheldon's room.
He's not wearing bottoms.

4
00:00:20,537 --> 00:00:21,577
[KNOCKING]

5
00:00:21,746 --> 00:00:24,166
Sheldon, you wanna catch me up again?

6
00:00:27,335 --> 00:00:29,255
(Gablehauser:)People, I am very busy today.

7
00:00:29,713 --> 00:00:32,843
I realize that, but it is your job
as head of the department...

8
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:35,088
...to mediate all intra-departmental
disputes.

9
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,510
University Policy Manual, Chapter 4,
subsection 2:

10
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:40,179
"Mediation
of Intra-departmental Disputes."

11
00:00:40,348 --> 00:00:41,348
[SCOFFS]

12
00:00:41,516 --> 00:00:43,016
(Gablehauser:)Fine.

13
00:00:43,184 --> 00:00:46,854
Dr. Winkle, what colorful name
did you call Dr. Cooper this time?

14
00:00:47,522 --> 00:00:49,352
(Leslie:)Dr. Dumb-ass.

15
00:00:51,693 --> 00:00:54,033
Dr. Cooper, Dr. Winkle apologizes.

16
00:00:54,195 --> 00:00:55,615
- No, she doesn't.
- No, I don't.

17
00:00:56,698 --> 00:01:00,698
(Sheldon:)Here's the problem. I was clearly signed up
to use the mainframe in Buckman 204...

